source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Let reversible changes (archive, move, star, read, labels) run without asking in one conversation. Sending, deleting, trash, spam and rules always ask

Usage: mxr assistant trust [OPTIONS] <CONVERSATION>

Arguments:
  <CONVERSATION>

Options:
      --off              Ask before every change again
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
